  "description": "Non-material amendment of planning permission 22/AP/2196 (Variation of condition 1 (Approved Plans) pursuant to planning permission 20/AP/2482 (Construction of four, part two/part three storey buildings incorporating roof terraces, for a temporary period of not more than seven years comprising uses including education in Building A (Use Class F1) and flexible education and office and ancillary uses (Use Classes F1 and E) in Buildings B, C and D, and associated refuse storage, cycle parking, electric substation and temporary landscaping.)\r\rNon-material amendments sought to to swap the permitted uses between building A and building D. Building A (currently F1 use) will operate under a Class E(g) use. Building D (currently Class E use) will operate under an F1 use. Amendment to the description of development to implement this change. As follows:\r\r\"Variation of condition 1 (Approved Plans) pursuant to planning permission 20/AP/2482 (Construction of four, part two/part three storey buildings incorporating roof terraces, for a temporary period of not more than seven years comprising uses including office in Building A (Use Class E(g), and flexible education and office and ancillary uses (Use Classes F1 and E) in Buildings B and C, and education in Building D (Use Class F1) and associated refuse storage, cycle parking, electric substation and temporary landscaping.)\"",
